@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed — Scoped roles, attributes and resource ownership
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Verified subject\naccount / current session or scoped credential" as S
rectangle "Scoped grant / role relationship\nactual resource namespace + operations + current version" as G
rectangle "Current resource attributes\nowner / lifecycle / expected version" as R
rectangle "Applicable accepted policy\nadmin powers require exact source reconciliation" as P
rectangle "Owner operation decision\nallow exact action or safe deny" as D
S --> D
G --> D
R --> D
P --> D
note bottom of G
 No global role inheritance, group model or RBAC product selected.
 Project/board membership is not repository/mailbox access.
 Unresolved policy is not an allow or a silent replacement of older powers.
end note

@enduml
